# NEG-10 (AC-8): a classifier that never chooses the noise lane fails a noise control.
rule: keep-noise
mutant: noise lane never chosen (rule 7 decides keep)
note: interim killing test: the spec names rescue n5 (its node_modules) and the guard, both red at f64a075; artifact_secret's node_modules must be noise and runs green. Add the n5 and guard pairs when they are enabled.
killing-test: rescue artifact_secret
assertion: /node_modules/pkg/index.js is Keep secret=None
--- a/crates/core/src/lanes.rs
+++ b/crates/core/src/lanes.rs
@@ -741,7 +741,7 @@
                         "regenerable"
                     };
                     return Decision {
-                        lane: Lane::Noise,
+                        lane: Lane::Keep,
                         reason: format!(
                             "a {class} directory (rule {rule}) that can be regenerated: {}",
                             it.reason
